; mnyororo.mapishi -- thibitisha kwamba vilivyogandishwa (msingi/awali.bin,
; msingi/mjenzi.bin na .hex zao) ni sawa kwa baiti na vinavyojengwa kutoka
; baiti 393 za mkono. Matokeo: jengo/awali, jengo/kusanyiko, jengo/mjenzi.
endesha msingi/mjenzi.bin gharama/awali-mpya.mapishi
sawa jengo/awali msingi/awali.bin
endesha msingi/kwanza.bin < msingi/awali.hex > jengo/awali_hex
sawa jengo/awali_hex msingi/awali.bin
sawa jengo/mjenzi msingi/mjenzi.bin
endesha msingi/kwanza.bin < msingi/mjenzi.hex > jengo/mjenzi_hex
sawa jengo/mjenzi_hex msingi/mjenzi.bin
andika mnyororo: mbegu, kusanyiko na mjenzi kutoka baiti 393 -- sawa kwa baiti
